{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115391","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115391/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115391/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115391/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115391","id":3856230311,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc7l2Wen","number":115391,"title":"Buttons do not take into account the shape of styleboxes","user":{"login":"dalexeev","id":47700418,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NzAwNDE4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47700418?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev","html_url":"https://github.com/dalexeev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097162,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTcxNjI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/discussion","name":"discussion","color":"ccaaff","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1732720779,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNzMyNzIwNzc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gui","name":"topic:gui","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-01-26T14:33:10Z","updated_at":"2026-01-26T16:40:29Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in 4.5.1.\n- Reproducible in current master.\n\n### System information\n\nKubuntu 25.10, Wayland\n\n### Issue description\n\nButtons don't respect the shape of styleboxes, such as the rounded corners of `StyleBoxFlat`. This means there's an implicit assumption that buttons are always rectangular, or at least nearly rectangular. This is generally a pretty good assumption. It's usually not that important (despite the fact that some rounding is present in most themes). However, with strong rounding, it looks wrong:\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c3485776-cfa8-4235-9ebe-0f03750f8c5f\n\nThere's a virtual method `_has_point()`, that you can override to fix this. This requires some simple, but non-trivial, math. The `Button` class doesn't override this method, but uses the default `Control` behavior.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nSee the description and MRP.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[buttons-are-always-rectangular.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/24861624/buttons-are-always-rectangular.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115391/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115391/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}